rd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#actions","content":"`onPress` is the Card primary. Nested buttons keep their own hits, so Save does not open the\nModal. Compose a Card inside the Modal when the action is a focused form."},"161":{"id":"/docs/components/card-25","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#checkbox","content":"Standalone checkbox Cards own their state. Grouped cards belong in CheckboxGroup.\nIndicator children can render custom content from the current selection state."},"162":{"id":"/docs/components/card-26","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#radio","content":"Radio Cards require a value and live in RadioGroup, which owns selection and arrow-key movement."},"163":{"id":"/docs/components/card-27","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#disabled","content":"`isDisabled` disables the Card's primary action or selection and fades the whole Card. A\ndisabled CheckboxGroup or RadioGroup does the same. Read-only selection keeps its value visible."},"164":{"id":"/docs/components/card-28","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#layout","content":"Use Grid for responsiveness."},"165":{"id":"/docs/components/card-29","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#customization","content":"Pass non-interactive children or a selection-state render function to `CardSelectionIndicator`\nto replace its default circle and icon. See the Checkbox example. Native selection and keyboard\nbehavior are preserved."},"166":{"id":"/docs/components/card-30","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#customization","content":"To style the Card by state, target `[data-card-selected]` and `[data-disabled]` from your\n`className`."},"167":{"id":"/docs/components/card-31","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#accessibility","content":"Name a primary action or selection with `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`. The stretched control\nand the selection input have no visible label of their own."},"168":{"id":"/docs/components/card-32","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#accessibility","content":"On a Card without a primary action or selection, `aria-label`, `aria-labelledby`, and\n`aria-describedby` apply to the surface, for example with `role=\"region\"`."},"169":{"id":"/docs/components/card-33","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#accessibility","content":"`href` turns the Card into a native link. Modifier-click, middle-click, and \"Open in new tab\" work\non the surface. Body text is not selectable. The link covers the whole Card, so do not put\nCornerActions, buttons, inputs, selection, or other controls in an `href` Card. Clicking body text\non an `onPress` or selection Card activates it; dragging that text selects it."},"170":{"id":"/docs/components/card-34","page_id":"/docs/components/card","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/card#accessibility","content":"`isDisabled` disables the primary action or selection and fades the Card. Controls you nest\ninside keep their own disabled state. Required and invalid state belong on `CheckboxGroup` or\n`RadioGroup`, and so does radio read-only state."},"171":{"id":"/docs/components/carousel","page_id":"/docs/components/carousel","type":"page","content":"Carousel","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/carousel"},"172":{"id":"/docs/components/carousel-0","page_id":"/docs/components/carousel","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/carousel","content":"The Carousel component allows users to cycle through a series of content panels (typically images, cards, or text) in a horizontal or vertical layout. It is commonly used for featured content, product showcases, or testimonials."},"173":{"id":"/docs/components/carousel-1","page_id":"/docs/components/carousel","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/carousel#installation","content":"Installation"},"174":{"id":"/docs/components/carousel-2","page_id":"/docs/components/carousel","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/carousel#examples","content":"Examples"},"175":{"id":"/docs/components/carousel-3","page_id":"/docs/components/carousel","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/carousel#default","content":"Default"},"176":{"id":"/docs/components/carousel-4","page_id":"/docs/components/carousel","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/carousel#controlled","content":"Controlled"},"177":{"id":"/docs/components/carousel-5","page_id":"/docs/components/carousel","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/carousel#external-controls-uncontrolled","content":"External Controls (Uncontrolled)"},"178":{"id":"/docs/components/carousel-6","page_id":"/docs/components/carousel","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/carousel#external-controls-controlled","content":"External Controls (Controlled)"},"179":{"id":"/docs/components/carousel-7","page_id":"/docs/components/carousel","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/carousel#hide-controls","content":"Hide Controls"},"180":{"id":"/docs/components/carousel-8","page_id":"/docs/components/carousel","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/carousel#variable-widths","content":"Variable Widths"},"181":{"id":"/docs/components/carousel-9","page_id":"/docs/components/carousel","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/carousel#events","content":"Events"},"182":{"id":"/docs/components/carousel-10","page_id":"/docs/components/carousel","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/carousel#rtl-direction","content":"RTL Direction"},"183":{"id":"/docs/components/carousel-11","page_id":"/docs/components/carousel","type"