 ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"],[558,"**Accessibility**: `aria-label`, `aria-describedby`, `role`, `title`"],[1248,"**Adopted** - inside a parent that provides its context (e.g. `Modal`), it picks up that parent's styling and spacing automatically. Consumer props still win over the adopted defaults."],[1457,"**Adornments**: Fixed text or icons before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`) are composed inside `Group`, positioned by source order"],[1504,"**An explicit prop on a child always wins** over what the lockup supplies. Pass\n`<Tag slot=\"eyebrow\" size=\"sm\">` to break the pairing, for instance."],[1053,"**Arrow Down/Right**: Move to next radio button"],[1565,"**Arrow Left / Right**"],[1179,"**Arrow Left/Right**: Move to next/previous segment"],[769,"**Arrow Right/Left**: open/close a submenu"],[768,"**Arrow Up/Down**: move between items; **Home/End**: first/last"],[1054,"**Arrow Up/Left**: Move to previous radio button"],[1710,"**Auto-sizing**: Uses VisX's `useParentSize` hook to adapt to container width"],[551,"**Automatic caching**: Once loaded, icons are cached for optimal performance"],[605,"**Automatic Caching**: Once loaded, the icon is cached in memory to avoid subsequent network requests"],[1706,"**Bar padding** (multi-series): 4px between bars within a group"],[1705,"**Bar width**: 12px (1.5 grid units)"],[556,"**Bento integration**: Extends Bento Icon with additional Antares-specific features"],[1708,"**Border radius**: 8px on all bars"],[1589,"**Center** — when the group acts as a prominent toggle affecting an entire section or page."],[1842,"**Chart container:** `data-width`, `data-height`, `data-x-labels`, `data-y-labels`, `data-x-labels-vertical`, `data-x-baseline`, `data-y-baseline`, `data-x-tick-marks`, `data-y-tick-marks`"],[629,"**Check browser console**: Look for network errors"],[1744,"**Check container**: Ensure the chart container is not transformed or positioned in a complex layout"],[1739,"**Check data**: Ensure `series` array has data and `xAccessor`/`yAccessor` return valid values"],[1741,"**Check dimensions**: Ensure container has non-zero width and height"],[1740,"**Check domains**: Verify `yDomain` (if set) includes your data values"],[627,"**Check icon name**: Ensure the icon exists in the CDN"],[1743,"**Check scroll position**: The component accounts for horizontal scroll automatically"],[240,"**Checkbox:** `data-selected`, `data-indeterminate`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[239,"**CheckboxGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[613,"**Client-Side Hydration**: The sprite sheet is generated and injected after hydration, causing a brief paint event"],[553,"**Color inheritance**: Uses `currentColor` by default for seamless theme integration"],[1456,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, `Input` or `TextArea`, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Omitting `Group` leaves the control as a direct field child with box chrome. Use an explicit `Group` for controls or adornments"],[380,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `DatePickerCalendar`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in. `children` also accepts a function for picker state"],[1209,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `SelectOptions`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1644,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, the control, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1211,"**Composed in another field**: Use `variant=\"control\"` to sit inside another field's `Group`, as a country-code select beside a phone `Input`"],[722,"**Composes into other components**: `Select` uses `ListBox` internally; reach for `ListBox` directly when you need an inline list rather than a popover dropdown."],[624,"**Consider preloading** frequently used icons to reduce loading delays"],[720,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` for controlled state, or `defaultSelectedKeys` for uncontrolled."],[1213,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1459,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1647,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1505,"**Controls keep their own type.** A `Button` inside a lockup is sized by its own `size` prop,\nnot the lockup's."],[1458,"**Controls**: A `Button slot=\"control\"` beside the input is an interactive affix; it picks up field chrome from context"],[1902,"**Custom Components:** When using `as={MyComponent}`, Box accepts that component's props. If there's a prop name conflict, Box's props take priority."],[1692,"**Custom domains**: Set explicit x and y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"],[1691,"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"],[1748,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[612,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[1689,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[614,"**DOM Output:**"],[1571,"**End**"],[559,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[1500,"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Anything unslotted is\nleft alone, which is what lets a nested component keep its own internal text. Forget the slot\nand the text simply renders untypeset rather than erroring."],[630,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[618,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[603,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[552,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1215,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[606,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[1707,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[1719,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[1569,"**Home**"],[1722,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[1711,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[1901,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[1892,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[581,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[621,"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"],[1690,"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart positioning and scroll-awareness"],[245,"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"],[244,"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"],[1714,"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"],[721,"**Layout primitive**: `ListBox` and `ListBoxItem` accept layout props (`gap`, `padding