rolling for many data points, sticky axes"],[1720,"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"],[1590,"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (e.g. grid/list view toggle)."],[1693,"**RTL support*&#x2A;: Full right-to-left layout support for international audiences &#x2A;(in development)*"],[1718,"**Scales**: VisX's `scaleBand` and `scaleLinear` for efficient coordinate mapping"],[1715,"**Screen reader support**: Semantic HTML structure with proper ARIA attributes"],[1176,"**SegmentedController Container:** `data-disabled`"],[1177,"**SegmentedControllerItem:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1239,"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."],[250,"**Shift + Tab**: Moves focus to the previous checkbox"],[1749,"**Simplify tooltips**: If tooltips are complex, consider using simpler content or disabling them"],[1686,"**Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series with grouped bars"],[1212,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"],[719,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"`."],[1567,"**Space / Enter**"],[1055,"**Space**: Select the focused radio button"],[249,"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"],[767,"**Space/Enter**: activate an item; **Escape**: close"],[1180,"**Space/Enter**: Select the focused segment"],[610,"**Sprite Sheet Creation**: A hidden SVG sprite sheet is automatically injected into the DOM containing symbol definitions"],[620,"**SSR Limitation**: Sprite references render empty until client-side hydration"],[1247,"**St